# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P1, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0. The two high
# sines are set up before the recording (the moves take ~8 s); the clip starts on them.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 2500
tap EDIT
turn K1 -40 60
turn K3 -40 60
tap HOME
tap HOME
turn K1 35 60
turn K3 36 60
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap HOME
turn K2 30 60
turn K4 30 60
wait 1500
wav bells.wav
# @ two pure sines, high, a tritone apart (C#6 and G6, near the top of their range), the Swell off
wait 1500
# @ key 11 twice, bend each other, X-mod up: they ring into one metallic, bell-like tone
tapkey b10
tapkey b10
tap LFO
tap LFO
turn K4 30 80
wait 5000
shot bells-0.png
# @ X-mod higher: the bells clang and run wild
turn K4 15 80
wait 7000
shot bells-1.png
wavstop
